# Asosiy manzil: HTTPS (Let's Encrypt sertifikati avtomatik).
# Domen bo'lmaguncha DOMAIN=<ip-chiziqcha>.sslip.io ishlatiladi — u server IP siga yo'naltiradi.
{$DOMAIN} {
	encode zstd gzip
	reverse_proxy api:8080
	header {
		Strict-Transport-Security "max-age=31536000"
		X-Content-Type-Options "nosniff"
		Referrer-Policy "strict-origin-when-cross-origin"
		-Server
	}
}

# Zaxira: IP orqali oddiy HTTP (sertifikat olinmaguncha yoki test uchun).
http://{$SERVER_IP} {
	encode zstd gzip
	reverse_proxy api:8080
}
